      "layout": "TITLE_ONLY",
      "title": "Java: 型・メソッド・文字列・コメントを塗り分ける（code_block）",
      "figures": [
        { "type": "code_block", "x": 0.5, "y": 1.1, "w": 6.1, "h": 2.1, "lang": "java",
          "code": "DistributedTransaction tx = manager.begin();  // 開始\ntry {\n  tx.put(Put.newBuilder()\n      .namespace(\"order\").table(\"orders\")\n      .partitionKey(Key.ofInt(\"order_id\", 10))\n      .textValue(\"status\", \"PAID\").build());\n  tx.commit();\n} catch (TransactionException e) {\n  tx.rollback();\n}" },
        { "type": "cards", "x": 6.85, "y": 1.1, "w": 2.65, "h": 2.1,
          "items": [["解説", "型は青緑、メソッドは黄、文字列は橙、コメントは緑"]] }
      ]
